educational purposes only. It is NOT a substitute for a professional security
audit, penetration test, or compliance assessment.

- Security findings are generated by algorithms and AI and may be incomplete,
  inaccurate, or inapplicable to your specific environment or threat model.
- Cost optimization suggestions are indicative estimates and may vary based on
  actual usage patterns, cloud provider pricing changes, and configuration.
- The copyright holder makes no guarantee that implementing any recommendation
  from this Software will eliminate security vulnerabilities, ensure compliance,
  or reduce costs.
- Users are solely responsible for their infrastructure security, compliance
  obligations, and any decisions made based on this Software's output.
- NEVER rely solely on this tool for production security decisions. Always
  engage qualified security professionals for critical systems.

